{
  "_comment": [
    "Frozen inventory of the Django models this backend was ported from, at commit 366b0d2.",
    "Extracted by AST from backend/campaign/models.py rather than transcribed by hand.",
    "This file is the reference the port is graded against. It is a record of what the",
    "schema WAS - do not edit it to make a failing eval pass. New fields added after the",
    "port belong in the models and the migration, and are allowed to have no entry here."
  ],
  "renamed": {
    "_comment": "Django name -> SQLAlchemy name. Every rename needs a reason recorded in README.",
